Comment: Generated from src/app/platform/copyright.in by the build. Dr Stein is
 installed in /@DRSTEIN_COPYRIGHT_PREFIX@ together with the Qt @DRSTEIN_QT_VERSION@ it was built
 with (libraries, plugins and QML modules) and the ICU libraries that Qt uses,
 unmodified, as the Qt online installer ships them.

